  speaker_name_from: 0
  textbox_title: Breanna
  fetch_localized_stat_value: 0
  dialogue_from: 0
  localized_key: 
  text: That was me with my Screenwriting professor last semester. I was taking it
    for my Film minor. <i>Everyone</i> had something bad to say about her.
